OL,3,GNEWSAFifteen arrested in ferry
OL,4,Aterminals immigration operation
OL,5,
OL,6,FFifteen people have been arrested in
OL,7,Fconnection with immigration offences
OL,8,Fduring a two-week long operation at
OL,9,Fferry terminals in south-west Scotland.
OL,11,FAs part of Operation Lockstream,
OL,12,Fofficers focused on Loch Ryan Port and
OL,13,FCairnryan Port, both located near
OL,14,FCairnryan village in Dumfries and
OL,15,FGalloway.
OL,17,FThe multi-agency operation targeted
OL,18,Forganised immigration crime across the
OL,19,Fcountry.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
