OL,3,GNEWSAFifteen arrested in ferry
OL,4,Aterminals immigration operation
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring their two weeks at the Scottish
OL,7,Fports, officers spoke to 340 people and
OL,8,Farrested 15 people aged between 20 and
OL,9,F54.
